* Where to look when something's wrong

# "Everyone ignores everyone" → level 1, rule of the arena: missing
#   object in dispute or missing clock.
# "I keep choosing the collision myself" → level 3, rule of
#   inevitability: none of the candidates was truly unavoidable.
# "The hook won't come out" → level 1: missing object in dispute,
#   missing clock, or missing force.
# "Nothing changes until the very end" → level 4: missing Adjustments
#   between the Breaks.
# "The cast feels scattered, four voices and no focus" → level 3 check
#   1 (every force owns a position) and level 5 check 3 (PoV
#   distribution).

